# 注意：必须用前导斜杠锚定到仓库根目录。
# 若写成裸 `server`，会连 `internal/server/` 整个源码目录一起忽略掉
# （曾因此导致 HTTP 处理与前端 UI 代码未被提交）。
# =============================================================================
/server
/ps5-manager
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
__debug_bin*

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool
*.out

# Go workspace file
go.work

# Dependencies (if vendor/ is used)
/vendor/

